   "Atlas/Rudvalis/CoordinateQuartetCompletion.lean:4:0: The module doc-string for a file should be the first command after the imports.\nPlease, add a module doc-string before `/--\nThree distinct coordinate members force an entire intrinsic quartet into the coordinate frame. -/\ntheorem quartet_containing_three_coordinate (Q : Set MinimalCross) (hQ : IsQuartet Q) (a b c : MinimalCross)\n    (ha : a ∈ Q) (hb : b ∈ Q) (hc : c ∈ Q) (hab : a ≠ b) (hac : a ≠ c) (hbc : b ≠ c) (haF : a ∈ coordinateFrame)\n    (hbF : b ∈ coordinateFrame) (hcF : c ∈ coordinateFrame) : Q ⊆ coordinateFrame :=\n  by\n  intro w hw\n  by_contra hwF\n  have haw : a ≠ w := fun h => hwF (h ▸ haF)\n  have hbw : b ≠ w := fun h => hwF (h ▸ hbF)\n  have hcw : c ≠ w := fun h => hwF (h ▸ hcF)\n  have hs : ({ a, b, c, w } : Set MinimalCross) ⊆ Q := by rintro z (rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl) <;> assumption\n  have hn : ({ a, b, c, w } : Set MinimalCross).ncard = 4 :=\n    Set.ncard_eq_four.mpr ⟨a, b, c, w, hab, hac, haw, hbc, hbw, hcw, rfl⟩\n  have he : ({ a, b, c, w } : Set MinimalCross) = Q := Set.eq_of_subset_of_ncard_le hs (by rw [hQ.1, hn])\n  apply hwF (quartet_three_in_coordinateFrame Q hQ w hw ?_)\n  intro z hz hzw\n  rw [← he] at hz\n  rcases hz with rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl\n  · exact haF\n  · exact hbF\n  · exact hcF\n  · exact (hzw rfl).elim`.\n\nNote: This linter can be disabled with `set_option linter.style.header false`",
